WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:15,770
This is how people live

2
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:17,570
Okay, I'm going to rest

3
00:00:17,570 --> 00:00:38,350
I felt a long-lost sense of protection.

4
00:00:38,350 --> 00:01:00,790
figured it out

5
00:01:00,790 --> 00:01:03,080
There is food and warmth here in Lindong

6
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:04,880
It's simply heaven on earth

7
00:01:04,880 --> 00:01:06,080
Salt noodles or something

8
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:08,080
Arrange a batch before eating

9
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:10,480
Survival is the most important thing

10
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:12,970
The only strange thing is

11
00:01:12,970 --> 00:01:15,170
I don’t know where Lindong’s food is hidden.

12
00:01:15,170 --> 00:01:16,970
The kitchen refrigerator is empty

13
00:01:16,970 --> 00:01:18,600
Is it placed in the bedroom?

14
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:19,800
But it changed

15
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:21,600
You can't go in without permission

16
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:26,030
It's so comfortable here

17
00:01:26,230 --> 00:01:28,230
The temperature of 26 degrees is really heaven on earth

18
00:01:28,230 --> 00:01:30,230
No need to die
